---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund & Cancellation Policy — HaikaiTech" description="Refund and cancellation policy for HaikaiTech Solutions.">
  <main class="min-h-screen font-sans bg-paper bg-grid-pattern">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to home</a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600 space-y-6">
        <p>This policy applies to services provided by HaikaiTech Solutions. Since we provide custom software development services (not physical goods), refunds are handled differently from product-based businesses.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Free Consultation Calls</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Initial consultations via WhatsApp or email are free and carry no financial obligation.</li>
          <li>We request 24 hours' notice for cancellation or rescheduling.</li>
          <li>Late cancellations or no-shows may result in rescheduling limitations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Project Work Refunds</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Projects are billed on a milestone basis as specified in the SOW.</li>
          <li><strong>Deposit:</strong> The initial deposit is non-refundable once work has commenced, as it covers project setup, research, and planning.</li>
          <li><strong>Completed milestones:</strong> Milestone payments that have been delivered and approved by the Client are non-refundable.</li>
          <li><strong>In-progress milestones:</strong> If a project is cancelled mid-milestone, the Client shall pay for work completed up to the cancellation date, calculated on a pro-rata basis.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Contact us directly at <a href="mailto:hq@haikaitech.my" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hq@haikaitech.my</a> to discuss the issue.</li>
          <li>We will work in good faith to resolve the concern, which may include revisions, scope adjustment, or partial refund as mutually agreed.</li>
          <li>If no resolution is reached, the matter will be referred to mediation in Penang, Malaysia.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">Contact</h2>
        <p>For any refund or cancellation requests, email <a href="mailto:hq@haikaitech.my" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hq@haikaitech.my</a> with your project details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
